@startuml
title AI Service - Recommendation And Chat
actor User
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "AI Recommendation API" as AI
participant "RecommendationService" as RecService
participant "Interaction Service" as Interaction
participant "Product Service" as Product
participant "Cart Service" as Cart
participant "Order Service" as Order
database "AI DB" as AIDB

== Home recommendations ==
User -> Gateway: GET /api/ai/recommendations/home
Gateway -> AI: home(user_id/session_id, limit)
AI -> RecService: recommend_home()
RecService -> Interaction: GET profile/events
Interaction --> RecService: behavior signals
RecService -> Product: GET product catalog
Product --> RecService: candidate products
RecService -> RecService: score heuristic + deep model when available
RecService -> AIDB: save RecommendationRequest + Results
RecService --> AI: ranked recommendations
AI --> Gateway: recommendation payload
Gateway --> User: recommendations

== Chat assistant ==
User -> Gateway: POST /api/ai/chat
Gateway -> AI: chat(message, session)
AI -> AIDB: save ChatMessage(user)
AI -> Cart: optional read current cart
AI -> Order: optional read orders
AI -> Product: optional product lookup/search
AI -> Interaction: optional profile/events lookup
AI -> AI: compose answer with retrieved context
AI -> AIDB: save ChatMessage(assistant)
AI --> Gateway: assistant answer
Gateway --> User: assistant answer
@enduml

